'''Valkyrie Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] unlocked by completing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] increases attack power and can [[Freeze|freeze]] non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is unlocked when clearing [[India (Into the Future)|India]] from [[Into the Future]] whilst her true from is unlocked from clearing [[Calabash Nebula (Cats of the Cosmos)|Calabash Nebula]] and leveled up to 20.

