==Trivia==
*Holy Valkyrie and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] are the first Cat Units to have [[Talents]] locked behind a stage.
*Her [[True Form]] has an unused halo that can be seen on the [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] update poster and in her spritesheet.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Valkyrie Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Valorous (Removed Combo)|Valorous]].
*On the initial release of [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] for every version of [[The Battle Cats]] except for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], a [https://youtu.be/zOgKVD13R2g&t=88 glitch] caused Valkyrie Cat to be missing her Meownir.
*"The curse is broken, and the savior of Catkind has returned!" refers to the fact that she used to be [[Corrupted Valkyrie]], corrupted by the curse of the dog lance Woofnir.
*Meownir is based on the spear [[wikipedia:Gungnir|Gungnir]] held by the God Odin in Norse Mythology and the hammer [[wikipedia:Mjölnir|Mjölnir]], held by Thor. Valhalla is also home to Odin and is a hall in Asgard. A Valkyrie is also one of Odin's heavenly warriors.
*True Valkyrie Cat's winged headpiece is similar to the ones worn by the Valkyries [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Lenneth|Lenneth]], [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Hrist|Hrist]] and [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Silmeria|Silmeria]] in the [[wikipedia:Valkyrie Profile|''Valkyrie Profile'']] series.
*[[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Val Val Cat]]'s armor is strongly implied to belong to Valkyrie Cat, though its bright blue coloration is a closer match for Lenneth from ''Valkyrie Profile''.
**During her attack and knockback animations, a leftover sliver of blue can be seen on Valkyrie Cat's visor, indicating that at some point it was intended to match the color seen on Val Val Cat's armor.
*The quote "Half of a Cat is made out of kindness" from her [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event|Merc Storia]] profile is a direct reference to the tagline of the painkiller [[wikipedia:ja:バファリン|Bufferin]], which can similarly be translated as "Half of a Bufferin is made out of kindness".
*Her Evolved Form's appearance in the [[Nyanko Daisensou 4Koma & Strategy App]] uses an [[Media:024 c HD.png|early wing design]] not seen in the final game. This design can be seen in one of the drawings for her [[Media:024 Concept.JPG|concept art]].
**[[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat) |Li'l Valkyrie]]'s and [[Li'l Valkyrie Dark (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie Dark]]'s wing designs more closely resemble the unused design than the used one, albeit with a darker colour scheme in Li'l Valkyrie Dark's case.
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Valkyrie Cat's English descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Valkyrie Cat
Descended from the fields of Valhalla
to provide salvation for the Battle Cats!
Uses the Heavenly Spear Meownir (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>True Valkyrie Cat
Changed to her final form.
Troubled because God keeps hitting on her.
Uses the Heavenly Spear Meownir (Area Attack)</pre>
**Her True Form's description was also altered, but the only change was capitalizing "freezing".

